<ul data-start=3D"2322" data-end=3D"2603">
<li data-start=3D"2322" data-end=3D"2370">
<p data-start=3D"2324" data-end=3D"2370"><strong data-start=3D"2324" data-e=
nd=3D"2340">Consist=C3=AAncia</strong> com o novo modelo de estoque;</p>
