 associada diretamente aos movimentos de sa=C3=ADda que ela gerou.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1471" data-end=3D"1474">
<h2 data-start=3D"1476" data-end=3D"1512">=F0=9F=94=81 Conex=C3=A3o com os =
Itens da Fatura</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1513" data-end=3D"1561">A tabela <code data-start=3D"1522"=
 data-end=3D"1535">itemfactura</code> tamb=C3=A9m precisaria conter:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1563" data-end=3D"1722">
<li data-start=3D"1563" data-end=3D"1590">
<p data-start=3D"1565" data-end=3D"1590">A unidade usada na venda;</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1591" data-end=3D"1634">
<p data-start=3D"1593" data-end=3D"1634">O fator de convers=C3=A3o (<code d=
ata-start=3D"1615" data-end=3D"1632">qtd_por_unidade</code>);</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1635" data-end=3D"1722">
<p data-start=3D"1637" data-end=3D"1722">E ser=C3=A1 ela que determina quan=
tos itens devem sair do armaz=C3=A9m via <code data-start=3D"1702" data-end=
=3D"1721">movimento_produto</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1724" data-end=3D"1727">
