start=3D"0" data-end=3D"232">Sim, <strong data-start=3D"5" data-end=3D"69">=
a tabela <code data-start=3D"16" data-end=3D"35">unidade_conversao</code> =
=C3=A9 extremamente =C3=BAtil em triggers</strong>, principalmente nos gati=
lhos (<code data-start=3D"100" data-end=3D"114">AFTER INSERT</code>, <code =
data-start=3D"116" data-end=3D"130">AFTER UPDATE</code>, etc.) que atualiza=
m o <strong data-start=3D"154" data-end=3D"172">saldo de stock</strong> ou =
processam <strong data-start=3D"186" data-end=3D"219">movimentos de entrada=
 e sa=C3=ADda</strong> de produtos.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"234" data-end=3D"237">
<h3 data-start=3D"239" data-end=3D"280">=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"245=
" data-end=3D"280">Como ela se aplica nas triggers</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"282" data-end=3D"492">Imagine que voc=C3=AA tenha uma trig=
ger que atualiza a tabela <code data-start=3D"339" data-end=3D"352">saldo_s=
tock</code> com base nos registros de entrada/sa=C3=ADda. Mas os movimentos=
 podem ser registrados em <strong data-start=3D"437" data-end=3D"466">caixa=
s, sacos ou unidades</strong>. A trigger precisa saber:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"494" data-end=3D"626">
<li data-start=3D"494" data-end=3D"551">
<p data-start=3D"496" data-end=3D"551">Qual =C3=A9 a <strong data-start=3D"=
505" data-end=3D"534">unidade alternativa usada</strong> na movimenta=C3=A7=
=C3=A3o.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"552" data-end=3D"626">
<p data-start=3D"554" data-end=3D"626">Qual =C3=A9 o fator de convers=C3=A3=
o para a <strong data-start=3D"589" data-end=3D"605">unidade base</strong> =
(padr=C3=A3o do sistema).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"628" data-end=3D"665">=C3=89 a=C3=AD que entra a <code dat=
a-start=3D"645" data-end=3D"664">unidade_conversao</code>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"667" data-end=3D"670">
<h3 data-start=3D"672" data-end=3D"705">=F0=9F=93=8C Exemplo de uso em trig=
ger:</h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"707" data-end=3D"720">Suponha:</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"721" data-end=3D"841">
<li data-start=3D"721" data-end=3D"739">
<p data-start=3D"723" data-end=3D"739">Produto <code data-start=3D"731" dat=
a-end=3D"739">id =3D 1</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"740" data-end=3D"799">
<p data-start=3D"742" data-end=3D"799">1 caixa =3D 12 unidades (registrado =
em <code data-start=3D"779" data-end=3D"798">unidade_conversao</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"800" data-end=3D"841">
<p data-start=3D"802" data-end=3D"841">O usu=C3=A1rio faz uma entrada de <c=
ode data-start=3D"831" data-end=3D"841">3 caixas</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"843" data-end=3D"861">A trigger precisa:</p>
<ol data-start=3D"862" data-end=3D"1053">
<li data-start=3D"862" data-end=3D"948">
<p data-start=3D"865" data-end=3D"948"><strong data-start=3D"865" data-end=
=3D"896">Buscar o fator de convers=C3=A3o</strong> da unidade usada (<code =
data-start=3D"915" data-end=3D"922">caixa</code>) para a base (<code data-s=
tart=3D"937" data-end=3D"946">unidade</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"949" data-end=3D"1009">
<p data-start=3D"952" data-end=3D"1009">Calcular a quantidade real: <code d=
ata-start=3D"980" data-end=3D"1009">3 caixas * 12 =3D 36 unidades</code></p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1010" data-end=3D"1053">
<p data-start=3D"1013" data-end=3D"1053">Atualizar o saldo com essas 36 uni=
dades.</p>
</li>
</ol>
