 data-end=3D"95">unidade_conversao</code></strong>, embora mencione <code d=
ata-start=3D"115" data-end=3D"147">(quantidade * qtd_por_unidade)</code>, q=
ue <strong data-start=3D"153" data-end=3D"163">sugere</strong> a presen=C3=
=A7a de um campo de convers=C3=A3o, <strong data-start=3D"201" data-end=3D"=
272">mas n=C3=A3o est=C3=A1 buscando essa informa=C3=A7=C3=A3o na tabela <c=
ode data-start=3D"251" data-end=3D"270">unidade_conversao</code></strong>.<=
/p>
<hr data-start=3D"275" data-end=3D"278">
<h3 data-start=3D"280" data-end=3D"304">=E2=9C=85 O que ela faz bem:</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"305" data-end=3D"607">
<li data-start=3D"305" data-end=3D"417">
<p data-start=3D"308" data-end=3D"417">Verifica se o registro do produto no=
 armaz=C3=A9m j=C3=A1 existe na tabela <code data-start=3D"373" data-end=3D=
"380">stock</code>, e se n=C3=A3o existir, cria com saldo 0.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"418" data-end=3D"492">
<p data-start=3D"421" data-end=3D"492">Atualiza o saldo do produto com base=
 nos movimentos de entrada e sa=C3=ADda.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"493" data-end=3D"607">
<p data-start=3D"496" data-end=3D"607">Usa <code data-start=3D"500" data-en=
d=3D"530">quantidade * qtd_por_unidade</code>, <strong data-start=3D"532" d=
ata-end=3D"606">supondo que <code data-start=3D"546" data-end=3D"563">qtd_p=
or_unidade</code> j=C3=A1 esteja presente na tabela <code data-start=3D"593=
" data-end=3D"604">movimento</code></strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"609" data-end=3D"612">
<h3 data-start=3D"614" data-end=3D"682">=E2=9D=8C O que falta para refletir=
 o uso da tabela <code data-start=3D"662" data-end=3D"681">unidade_conversa=
o</code>:</h3>
<p data-start=3D"684" data-end=3D"892">Atualmente, a trigger <strong data-s=
tart=3D"706" data-end=3D"770">n=C3=A3o busca o fator de convers=C3=A3o na t=
abela <code data-start=3D"749" data-end=3D"768">unidade_conversao</code></s=
trong>, que =C3=A9 o objetivo principal de se ter essa tabela separada. Par=
a us=C3=A1-la corretamente, a trigger deveria fazer algo assim:</p>
<hr data-start=3D"894" data-end=3D"897">
<h3 data-start=3D"899" data-end=3D"946">=E2=9C=85 Vers=C3=A3o melhorada com=
 <code data-start=3D"926" data-end=3D"945">unidade_conversao</code>:</h3>
<p data-start=3D"948" data-end=3D"958">Assumindo:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"959" data-end=3D"1131">
<li data-start=3D"959" data-end=3D"1052">
<p data-start=3D"961" data-end=3D"1052">Tabela <code data-start=3D"968" dat=
a-end=3D"987">unidade_conversao</code> tem colunas: <code data-start=3D"100=
1" data-end=3D"1016">fk_id_produto</code>, <code data-start=3D"1018" data-e=
nd=3D"1033">fk_id_unidade</code>, <code data-start=3D"1035" data-end=3D"105=
2">qtd_por_unidade</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1053" data-end=3D"1131">
<p data-start=3D"1055" data-end=3D"1131">A tabela <code data-start=3D"1064"=
 data-end=3D"1075">movimento</code> informa o <code data-start=3D"1086" dat=
a-end=3D"1101">fk_id_unidade</code> (a unidade usada na opera=C3=A7=C3=A3o)=
</p>
</li>
</ul>
