<hr data-start=3D"2544" data-end=3D"2547">
<h3 data-start=3D"2549" data-end=3D"2581">=E2=9C=85 Vantagens desta abordag=
em:</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2582" data-end=3D"2835">
<li data-start=3D"2582" data-end=3D"2677">
<p data-start=3D"2584" data-end=3D"2677">Permite registrar movimentos em <s=
trong data-start=3D"2616" data-end=3D"2648">qualquer unidade alternativa</s=
trong>, como caixa, kg, litro, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2678" data-end=3D"2769">
<p data-start=3D"2680" data-end=3D"2769">Garante que o <strong data-start=
=3D"2694" data-end=3D"2750">saldo de stock seja sempre baseado na unidade p=
adr=C3=A3o</strong> (base) do produto.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2770" data-end=3D"2835">
<p data-start=3D"2772" data-end=3D"2835">Centraliza a l=C3=B3gica de conver=
s=C3=A3o na tabela <code data-start=3D"2815" data-end=3D"2834">unidade_conv=
ersao</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2837" data-end=3D"2840">
<h3 data-start=3D"2842" data-end=3D"2859">=F0=9F=94=84 Conclus=C3=A3o:</h3>
<p data-start=3D"2860" data-end=3D"3038">A sua trigger atual <strong data-s=
