=A1 est=C3=A1 na tabela <code data-start=3D"2925" data-end=3D"2936">movimen=
to</code> via <code data-start=3D"2941" data-end=3D"2958">qtd_por_unidade</=
code>, o que funciona, mas <strong data-start=3D"2980" data-end=3D"3037">n=
=C3=A3o utiliza a tabela <code data-start=3D"3003" data-end=3D"3022">unidad=
e_conversao</code> como deveria</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"3040" data-end=3D"3284" data-is-last-node=3D"" data-is-onl=
y-node=3D"">Se voc=C3=AA quiser realmente usar a <code data-start=3D"3072" =
