<li data-start=3D"1496" data-end=3D"1649">
<p data-start=3D"1498" data-end=3D"1649">Para utilizar essa tabela, voc=C3=
=AA teria que <strong data-start=3D"1540" data-end=3D"1580">incorporar l=C3=
=B3gica extra nos triggers</strong> (como a busca do fator de convers=C3=A3=
o conforme a unidade movimentada).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1650" data-end=3D"1851" data-is-last-node=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1652" data-end=3D"1851" data-is-last-node=3D"">Outra abord=
agem poss=C3=ADvel: fazer esse controle <strong data-start=3D"1698" data-en=
