<hr data-start=3D"904" data-end=3D"907">
<h3 data-start=3D"909" data-end=3D"941">=E2=9A=99=EF=B8=8F Explicando o Enc=
adeamento</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"943" data-end=3D"1264">
<li data-start=3D"943" data-end=3D"1005">
<p data-start=3D"946" data-end=3D"1005"><strong data-start=3D"946" data-end=
=3D"1005">Venda acontece =E2=86=92 <code data-start=3D"965" data-end=3D"978=
">itemfactura</code> recebe um novo registro.</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1006" data-end=3D"1125">
<p data-start=3D"1009" data-end=3D"1125"><strong data-start=3D"1009" data-e=
nd=3D"1037"><code data-start=3D"1011" data-end=3D"1035">trigger_registra_sa=
ida</code></strong> insere automaticamente uma linha na tabela <code data-s=
tart=3D"1081" data-end=3D"1092">movimento</code>, com <code data-start=3D"1=
098" data-end=3D"1124">tipo_movimento =3D 'Sa=C3=ADda'</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1126" data-end=3D"1264">
<p data-start=3D"1129" data-end=3D"1264"><strong data-start=3D"1129" data-e=
nd=3D"1164"><code data-start=3D"1131" data-end=3D"1162">trigger_actualiza_s=
tock_saida</code></strong> detecta o novo <code data-start=3D"1180" data-en=
d=3D"1191">movimento</code> do tipo "Sa=C3=ADda" e <strong data-start=3D"12=
10" data-end=3D"1263">atualiza o <code data-start=3D"1223" data-end=3D"1230=
">stock</code> subtraindo o total de unidades</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"1266" data-end=3D"1269">
<h3 data-start=3D"1271" data-end=3D"1321">=F0=9F=94=84 Se voc=C3=AA remover=
 o <code data-start=3D"1296" data-end=3D"1320">trigger_registra_saida</code=
>:</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1322" data-end=3D"1539">
<li data-start=3D"1322" data-end=3D"1421">
<p data-start=3D"1324" data-end=3D"1421">Nenhuma linha ser=C3=A1 inserida a=
utomaticamente na tabela <code data-start=3D"1378" data-end=3D"1389">movime=
nto</code> ap=C3=B3s uma venda (<code data-start=3D"1406" data-end=3D"1419"=
>itemfactura</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1422" data-end=3D"1539">
<p data-start=3D"1424" data-end=3D"1539">Consequentemente, <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"1442" data-end=3D"1494"><code data-start=3D"1444" data-end=3D"1475">t=
rigger_actualiza_stock_saida</code> n=C3=A3o ser=C3=A1 ativado</strong>, e =
o <strong data-start=3D"1500" data-end=3D"1538">saldo de stock n=C3=A3o ser=
=C3=A1 atualizado</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1541" data-end=3D"1544">
<h3 data-start=3D"1546" data-end=3D"1561">=E2=9C=85 Conclus=C3=A3o</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1563" data-end=3D"1720"><strong data-start=3D"1563" data-e=
nd=3D"1610">Sim, o <code data-start=3D"1572" data-end=3D"1596">trigger_regi=
stra_saida</code> =C3=A9 essencial</strong> no modelo atual. Ele =C3=A9 que=
m "liga" a venda (<code data-start=3D"1655" data-end=3D"1668">itemfactura</=
code>) ao sistema de movimenta=C3=A7=C3=A3o e atualiza=C3=A7=C3=A3o de stoc=
k.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1722" data-end=3D"2015" data-is-last-node=3D"" data-is-onl=
y-node=3D"">Caso deseje <strong data-start=3D"1734" data-end=3D"1780">centr=
alizar toda a l=C3=B3gica na <code data-start=3D"1765" data-end=3D"1778">it=
emfactura</code></strong>, voc=C3=AA teria que migrar a l=C3=B3gica de subt=
ra=C3=A7=C3=A3o de stock diretamente para um trigger em <code data-start=3D=
"1866" data-end=3D"1879">itemfactura</code>, o que <strong data-start=3D"18=
87" data-end=3D"1908">n=C3=A3o =C3=A9 recomendado</strong> se voc=C3=AA qui=
ser manter uma tabela <code data-start=3D"1942" data-end=3D"1953">movimento=
</code> como <strong data-start=3D"1959" data-end=3D"1991">registro hist=C3=
=B3rico unificado</strong> para entradas e sa=C3=ADdas.</p></div></div></di=
